    "Simulation is active. ThermalPilot does not control heating.": "Modeliavimas aktyvus. ThermalPilot nevaldo šildymo.",
    "Observation and learning only; no thermostat control.": "Tik stebėjimas ir mokymasis; be valdymo.",
    "ThermalPilot controls thermostat targets.": "ThermalPilot valdo termostatų nuostatas.",
    "Seasonal fallback temperatures are used.": "Naudojamos sezoninės atsarginės temperatūros.",
    "Scheduled targets remain simulated; season transitions can change thermostat targets.": "Planas modeliuojamas; sezonų kaita gali keisti tikras nuostatas.",
    "Live thermostat control is not enabled.": "Tikrasis valdymas neįjungtas.",
    "Target changes include the shared start/stop offsets. The temperature forecast models the planned heating period; actual valve and heat-pump delays must be checked against observations.": "Įtraukti pradžios ir pabaigos poslinkiai. Tikrinkite tikras vožtuvų ir siurblio delsas.",
    "These forecasts were saved 1, 3 or 6 hours before the measurements. Later readings do not change them. Lower error is better; compare it with simply predicting no temperature change. Different heating, computers and other heat sources can affect the result.": "Prognozės išsaugotos prieš 1, 3 ar 6 valandas ir vėliau nekinta. Mažesnis nuokrypis geriau; lyginkite su pastovia temperatūra. Kiti šilumos šaltiniai veikia rezultatą.",
    "Compare recorded temperatures with forecasts saved hours earlier. The accuracy cards also compare against predicting no temperature change. Forecasts assume the proposed heating plan; actual heating may differ, especially during simulation.": "Lyginkite matavimus su ankstesnėmis prognozėmis ir pastovia temperatūra. Tikras šildymas gali skirtis, ypač modeliuojant.",
    "Forecasts are compared with measurements within five minutes of their due time. “Similar heating” means observed demand matched the forecast for at least 90% of observations, with no large recording gaps. These counts give context, not a guarantee of accuracy.": "Matavimas per penkias minutes nuo termino. Panašus šildymas: bent 90% atitikimas be didelių spragų. Skaičiai negarantuoja tikslumo.",
    "Each row shows the latest observation within its 15-minute interval, not an average. Suggested thermostat target is the setting ThermalPilot would apply, not a room-temperature forecast. Table shows up to 288 intervals. Original observations remain stored internally. Short chart views use 15-minute time labels; longer views use wider intervals.": "Paskutinis stebėjimas kas 15 minučių, ne vidurkis. Nuostata yra termostato nustatymas, ne prognozė. Iki 288 intervalų; originalai lieka.",
    "Suggested On means the boosted target window, including valve timing offsets. Relay On means observed demand; it does not guarantee heat flow.": "Siūlomas įjungimas reiškia pakeltą nuostatą su vožtuvų poslinkiais. Relė rodo poreikį, ne garantuotą srautą.",
    ", without heating, remaining slab warmth or appliance heat. Lower temperature loss means slower modeled cooling. This is a model estimate, not measured energy efficiency or an insulation rating.": ", be šildymo, likutinės ar prietaisų šilumos. Mažesnis nuostolis reiškia lėtesnį modeliuojamą vėsimą; tai ne našumo ar izoliacijos rodiklis.",
    "Cooling-speed bands are provisional: under 1 h, 1–2 h, 2–4 h, 4–8 h, and 8 h or longer per 1°C drop. For a selected house type, badges instead compare with that type: under 0.5×, 0.5–0.8×, 0.8–1.25×, 1.25–2×, and at least 2× its reference cooling time. Initial rooms share starting estimates and remain unrated. Comparisons become more useful as their heat-loss parameters adapt to observations. Wind, ventilation, sensor placement and unmeasured heat sources can affect the estimates. The listed time describes this reference test, not how long heating can safely remain off in your home.": "Pradiniai modeliai vienodi. Vėjas, vėdinimas, jutikliai ir kiti šaltiniai veikia palyginimą. Atskaitos laikas nėra saugi šildymo pertrauka.",
    "Learned parameters and season aggregates are retained when old observations are compacted.": "Išmokti parametrai ir sezonų suvestinės išlieka glaudinant istoriją.",
    "Open a Home Assistant dashboard once, then return here to load embedded history cards.": "Atverkite Home Assistant skydelį ir grįžkite įkelti istorijos.",
    "Water-based systems only: raise the thermostat target this many minutes before the planned heat-delivery session, allowing slow valves to open. Electric and air distribution ignore this setting and use no advance offset.": "Tik vanduo: pakelti anksčiau lėtiems vožtuvams atidaryti. Elektra ir oras ignoruoja poslinkį.",
    "Water-based systems only: lower the thermostat target this many minutes before the planned heat-delivery session ends, allowing valves to close. Electric and air distribution ignore this setting and use no closing offset.": "Tik vanduo: nuleisti prieš pabaigą vožtuvams uždaryti. Elektra ir oras ignoruoja poslinkį.",
    "What produces heat for your house. Select air-to-water for your water floor system supplied by an air-source heat pump. Gas, oil, wood and district heating need their own fuel-cost logic; choosing a house detail does not yet enable a different controller or reset learned room data.": "Namo šilumos šaltinis. Kuro sistemoms nėra kainų valdymo; duomenys išlieka.",
    "How heat reaches rooms: circulating water in floors or radiators, electric floor/ceiling/panels, or warm air. Mixed means different rooms use different systems. Water distribution can optionally use a heating-water sensor and uses valve timing. Electric and warm-air distribution ignore those inputs and learn response from observed thermostat demand. Mixed and Other retain water requirements until room overrides are supported.": "Paskirstymas: vanduo naudoja vožtuvų laikus ir neprivalomą jutiklį; elektra ir oras mokosi iš poreikio. Mišrus išlaiko vandens nustatymus.",
    "The construction around floor heating, which affects how slowly heat is stored and released. Concrete slab describes your heated floor. Choose Not applicable if there is no floor heating. This does not change your configured response lag or erase learned parameters.": "Grindys veikia kaupimą. Be grindų šildymo rinkitės Netaikoma. Nekeičia delsos ar modelio.",
    "The structure below your home: slab on ground, crawl space or basement. A heated concrete floor can be above a basement, so this is separate from Heated floor. Choose Unknown if unsure. This descriptive setting does not reset observation history or learned models.": "Pamatai atskiri nuo šildomų grindų. Jei nežinote, rinkitės Nežinoma. Istorija ir modeliai išlieka.",
    "Sunlight through large windows, especially south-facing windows, can warm a room. No additional physical solar heating system is needed. Select the main direction of those windows to enable solar estimates, or Solar heating off to turn them off. Home Assistant’s location determines seasonal sun elevation and azimuth; cloud conditions come from your weather source. The effect starts at zero and learns gradually. Missing sunlight data assumes no solar warmth; room temperature limits still apply.": "Saulė pro langus, papildomos sistemos nereikia. Kryptis ir vieta duoda saulės padėtį, orai debesuotumą. Mokosi nuo nulio. Be duomenų saulės šiluma neįskaitoma; ribos galioja.",
    "Clear means the windows receive direct sunlight without major obstructions. Choose Partly shaded for some trees, buildings or overhangs, or Mostly shaded when sunlight is usually blocked. Forecasts use a more cautious solar allowance: partly shaded uses 65% and mostly shaded 30% of the clear allowance. Actual room warming is still learned from observations; no solar heat is assumed before learning. Seasonal leaf cover and changing shading can still affect accuracy.": "Neužstota, iš dalies ar daugiausia užstota: prognozė naudoja 100%, 65% ar 30% saulės indėlio. Šilimas išmokstamas; šešėliai gali kisti.",
    "Optional local wind sensor, for example sensor.netatmo_tuuli_ms using m/s. Valid readings are averaged over the last 30 minutes. ThermalPilot learns a separate wind effect only after enough varied observations; no fixed wind penalty is assumed. Missing, invalid or unchanged-for-two-hours readings are ignored, and normal temperature-based planning and heating continue. Fresh wind correction gradually returns to typical conditions in forecasts further ahead. A stable calm reading may also be ignored conservatively. Units are detected automatically.": "Vėjas neprivalomas, automatiniai vienetai ir 30 min vidurkis. Mokosi iš kintančių duomenų. Trūkstami, netinkami ar 2 val. nekintantys rodmenys ignoruojami; šildymas tęsiasi. Tolimos prognozės grįžta prie įprasto vėjo.",
    "Emergency lower temperature limit shared by all rooms. Each room’s own target is the normal comfort goal. ThermalPilot prioritizes avoiding this limit even when electricity is expensive; this value is not the idle thermostat target.": "Absoliuti apatinė riba, ne ramybės nuostata. Kambario tikslas yra komfortas; riba saugoma ir brangiomis valandomis.",
    "Upper temperature limit shared by all rooms. Extra heating and heat storage must stay within this limit.": "Visų kambarių viršutinė riba; papildoma šiluma negali viršyti.",
    "Optional sensor with forecast timestamp/value entries, such as Nordpool Predict FI. Only relative expensive/cheap patterns after confirmed prices are used, so no forecast price unit or additional costs are required. The Source price unit setting applies only to the confirmed total-price sensor. An expensive upcoming period can increase the heat reserve at the end of the known-price plan. Forecast prices are not compared directly with your total prices, used as confirmed prices or used to execute future heating commands. Missing forecasts keep normal planning. Confirmed prices always determine the executable schedule.": "Neprivaloma kainų tendencija po patvirtintų kainų. Vienetų ir papildomų išlaidų nereikia. Gali didinti atsargą; niekada ne patvirtinta kaina ar būsima komanda. Be prognozės įprastas planas.",
    "Notify in Home Assistant when a room temperature sensor stays unchanged or unavailable for this many hours. A stable room can also have an unchanged reading, so the warning asks you to check the sensor. ThermalPilot sends at most one sensor notification per calendar day. Monitoring runs while ThermalPilot is active; long monitoring gaps restart the timer.": "Įspėti po šio laiko esant nekintančiai ar trūkstamai temperatūrai.",
    "Summer fallback always applies from 15.5. through 30.9. Outside those dates, it also applies when the day’s lowest forecast temperature is equal to or above this value. For example, a setting of 6°C means the daily minimum must be at least 6°C for ThermalPilot to use summer fallback temperatures. Lower readings already observed that day are included. If a full-day forecast is unavailable outside the summer dates, winter fallback is used.": "Vasara 15.5.–30.9. arba dienos prognozės minimumui pasiekus ribą. Be prognozės už laikotarpio vasara neįjungiama.",
    "Negative values reduce estimated heat loss while the fireplace is active; −20% means a 20% reduction.": "Neigiamos reikšmės mažina nuostolius veikiant židiniui; −20% reiškia 20% mažiau.",
    "Prefer a sensor that includes electricity prices and additional costs, such as VAT, transfer tariffs, electricity tax and retailer margin. A variable electricity-price sensor without these costs also works. If transfer tariffs differ between day and night, including them helps ThermalPilot choose the cheapest heating hours; omitting them can shift heating to hours that are less economical overall. Select a source containing today/tomorrow or timestamped raw_today/raw_tomorrow price lists, and choose the matching source price unit.": "Pageidautina visa kaina su PVM, perdavimu, mokesčiais ir marža. Kintama kaina be priedų irgi veikia; dienos/nakties perdavimo tarifų trūkumas gali bloginti valandų pasirinkimą. Naudokite today/tomorrow ar datuotus raw_today/raw_tomorrow ir teisingą vienetą.",
    "Hourly average uses fixed hourly averages of the source prices. 15 minutes plans using quarter-hour intervals. Flexible builds heating sessions in 15-minute steps, allowing runs such as 60 or 75 minutes while respecting the minimum flexible heating run.": "Valandos vidurkis, 15 min intervalai ar lankstūs 15 min žingsniai su minimalia trukme.",
    "The shortest planned heating session in flexible scheduling mode. Longer sessions can be chosen in 15-minute steps. This setting applies to flexible runs; valve opening and closing offsets are applied separately.": "Trumpiausias lankstus laikotarpis; ilgesni 15 min žingsniais.",
    "Initial estimate of how slowly heat input affects room temperature and how long its effect persists. Concrete slabs often need a longer delay, but lightweight floors, radiators, electric heaters and air systems also have a response time. Use a shorter value for faster systems. This remains relevant to every distribution; it is separate from valve opening or closing time.": "Pradinis inercijos ir likutinio poveikio įvertis; modelis išmoksta tikrą reakciją.",
    "The warm outdoor endpoint of the initial heating-hours curve. At this temperature or warmer, the starting model assumes the lower daily heating need. This curve seeds the model before enough real heating and cooling observations are available.": "Pradinio dienos šildymo poreikio šiltasis taškas; tikra reakcija išmokstama.",
    "The cold outdoor endpoint of the initial heating-hours curve. At this temperature or colder, the starting model assumes the higher daily heating need. Set it below the warm endpoint. Actual room response is learned from observations.": "Pradinis šaltasis taškas žemiau šiltojo; tikra reakcija išmokstama.",
    "Allows real thermostat setpoint changes when ThermalPilot changes between Active and Passive. Active applies each room’s target temperature; Passive applies the seasonal fallback: the shared summer setpoint or each room’s normal target in winter. These commands can occur even with simulation enabled. This does not enable live heating schedule control.": "Įjungia tikras sezonines nuostatas net modeliuojant: aktyvus kambario tikslas, pasyvus vasaros/žiemos atsarga. Neįjungia grafikų.",
    "The thermostat target used for all configured rooms while ThermalPilot is Passive, if real Active/Passive season setpoint control is enabled. A low summer target normally prevents heating without switching off the thermostats.": "Bendras vasaros tikslas pasyviame sezoniniame valdyme. Žema nuostata neleidžia šildyti neišjungiant termostatų.",
    "Degrees added to each room’s target temperature during a suggested heating window. For example, a 20 °C target with a 1.5 °C boost suggests a 21.5 °C thermostat setpoint to store heat. Scheduled targets remain simulated in this version.": "Laipsniai virš kambario tikslo šilumai kaupti, pvz. 20 + 1,5 = 21,5°C.",
    "Negative values temporarily lower the thermostat target during expensive electricity hours. After a planned heating session, ThermalPilot first restores the room’s normal target. It then chooses reduction only when predicted stored warmth can avoid thermostat heating while supporting room comfort. For example, −1°C allows a 20°C target to be reduced to 19°C during selected costly hours. The reduced target never goes below Minimum allowed temperature. Normal target is restored when reduction is no longer useful; a new planned heating session uses the boosted target. Duration is chosen by the plan, not a fixed number of hours.": "Neigiamas sumažinimas tik brangiomis valandomis turint šilumos atsargą. Po šildymo pirma normali nuostata. Niekada žemiau minimumo; atkuriama, kai nenaudinga. Trukmė pagal planą.",
    "Select the measured supply-water temperature. A temperature sensor uses its state; a climate entity uses its current_temperature attribute. This is the measured water temperature, not the thermostat’s target. Optional for water-based systems. A valid reading adjusts the estimated heating output. Without it, planning and learning continue from observed thermostat demand, without a water-temperature adjustment. Missing readings do not force fallback targets.": "Neprivaloma išmatuota tiekimo temperatūra; climate naudoja current_temperature, ne tikslą. Koreguoja galią. Trūkumas nestabdo plano ar mokymosi ir neįjungia atsargos.",
    "Simulation calculates heating suggestions without applying scheduled targets. Disable simulation and confirm to enable real thermostat control. If another automation controls these thermostats, disable it first. Observation and learning continue in both modes.": "Modeliavimas netaiko grafikų. Išjunkite ir patvirtinkite tikram valdymui; išjunkite kitą susijusią automatiką, jei yra. Mokymasis tęsiasi abiem režimais.",
    "Choose the interface language. Room and entity names remain unchanged. Save settings to keep the choice. Embedded history cards follow this choice where supported by Home Assistant.": "Pasirinkite kalbą ir išsaugokite. Kambarių ir objektų vardai nekinta. Įterpta istorija seka kalbą, jei palaikoma.",
    "All room timelines share the price chart’s time axis.${zones.length?' Zone rows show recorded heating and cooling only; off and standby periods stay empty. Plan adds suggested heating only for tariff-optimized zones.':''} Teal shows the suggested thermostat boost window; amber shows observed heating demand. ": "Bendra laiko ašis. Turkis: pakėlimas; oranžinė: stebėtas poreikis. ",
    "The selected period controls past history. Today and tomorrow are included when prices are published. Recorded activity is shown before now; future suggestions follow the current plan. Price gaps stay empty. ": "Laikotarpis nustato istoriją; šiandien ir rytoj su kainomis. Iki dabar: stebėjimai; po: dabartinis planas. Kainų spragos tuščios. ",
    "Times align to 15-minute boundaries; wider views show fewer labels. Hover, focus or tap a price bar or heating period for details.": "15 min ribos; ilgesniuose rodiniuose mažiau etikečių. Užveskite, fokusuokite ar palieskite detalėms.",
    "This measures initial data collection, not model trustworthiness. Continue validating forecasts and heating suggestions before enabling live control. Learning continues after initial data collection.": "Pradinis rinkimas nematuoja patikimumo. Tikrinkite prognozes ir pasiūlymus prieš valdymą; mokymasis tęsiasi.",
    "History collection and learning paused because outdoor temperature is unavailable. Existing model parameters are retained.": "Istorija ir mokymasis pristabdyti: lauko temperatūros nėra. Modelis išlieka.",
    "No weather forecast: current outdoor temperature is held constant.": "Orų prognozės nėra; lauko temperatūra laikoma pastovia.",
    "Live control awaits confirmation. Enable simulation, save, then disable it and confirm to activate thermostat control.": "Valdymas laukia patvirtinimo. Įjunkite modeliavimą, išsaugokite, tada išjunkite ir patvirtinkite.",
    "Waiting for enough heating and idle observations to estimate the remaining time.": "Laiko įverčiui laukiama daugiau šildymo ir ramybės stebėjimų.",
    "A door/window contact sensor can monitor the fireplace damper position. Select the sensor state that means the fireplace is in use. For a damper contact sensor, Open normally means active and Closed means inactive. Door/window labels are converted to Home Assistant’s underlying on/off values. Other sensors show their declared options, current valid state and any saved value. A contact state indicates the damper position; it does not prove that a fire is burning.": "Durų/langų kontaktas ant sklendės: Atidaryta paprastai aktyvu, Uždaryta neaktyvu. Išsaugoma on/off. Kiti jutikliai rodo būsenas. Padėtis neįrodo degančios ugnies.",
